**How we'll use your climate data:**

This information is sent to the **{{tm.harvestSageTM}}** AI, which calculates the required specifications for your modules. It will determine the optimal **{{tm.pureLightTM}}** panel thickness and pre-configure the **{{tm.precisionHeatTM}}** system to maintain perfect root-zone temperatures, protecting your plants from extremes and optimizing energy use automatically.

